  "notes": "安全更新与登录提交保护。\n\n- 将 Go 运行时更新至 1.27.3，修复证书验证安全问题 GO-2026-6809。\n- 包含此前为未发布的 v1.3.144 准备的登录修复：响应缓慢或结果不确定时，一次登录操作不会自动再次提交账号密码。\n- 保留发送登录请求前的连接切换、原有双重验证流程，以及出错后的手动重试。\n",
  "notesEn": "Security update and login submission protection.\n\n- Update the Go runtime to 1.27.3 for the certificate-verification security fix GO-2026-6809.\n- Include the login fix prepared for v1.3.144, which was not published: one login action does not automatically resubmit credentials after a slow or uncertain response.\n- Preserve connection fallback before submission, the existing two-factor flow and manual retries after an error.\n",
